# Docker images (docker/) are built from the repository root but only need the
# package sources and the LAMMPS pair style. Allowlist those; everything else
# (tests, docs, datasets, virtualenvs, .git) stays out of the build context.
*
!src/
!lammps/
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
